              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "C Dorr"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We eat pork chops quite often and I was skeptical with what is in this recipe! My wife likes lemon, so I decided to give it a try! I used center cut pork chops... 8 total! My wife and I didn't care for this recipe... the chops didn't taste good at all!!! I marinated them 24 hours in the frig and decided to fry them in a frying pan on top of the stove instead of using a grill or oven. By doing that, it's no different than putting them on a gas grill... unless a person uses charcoal. There was so much liquid (marinade) in the chops I had to pour some out so they would sear and brown up. The marinade liquid would've definitely done the same thing in the oven. First and last time I'll make these!",
            "datePublished": "2018-02-01T21:24:52.280Z"
